sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Caller
  participant S as Trusted sender
  participant C as OCC
  participant P as Provider
  Note over S,P: After preparation: actual operation is immutable
  S->>C: Fresh online check
  Note over S,P: Caller, versioned route, grant and actual operation<br/>Selected material identity/version or explicit absence
  C-->>S: Allow, deny or unavailable
  Note over S,P: Policy receives no credential bytes<br/>Do not substitute another operation or material
  alt Allow, usable material if needed, within deadlines
    S->>S: Recheck usability,<br/>send-start and original<br/>operation deadlines
    S->>P: Strip Agent auth,<br/>inject if needed, send once
    P-->>S: Response, error or stream
    S-->>A: Safe response,<br/>redaction or refusal
  else Denied, unavailable, unusable or too late
    S-->>A: Refuse before send
  end
  Note over A,P: Each subrequest, redirect, retry or new operation repeats the checks<br/>Resolve again when needed#59; no provider material or handles enter the Agent
